    "sub_name": "學期專業實習(二)",
    "sub_ename": "SEMESTER INTERNSHIP(2)",
    "describe_ch": "本課程為遴選學生提供至產業進行實務接軌的機會，目的在於結合產業資源，強化學生理論與實務的整合，培養學生正確的職場態度，提升未來就業競爭力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is designed for the student to have the opportunity in industry collaborative practice. It aims to integrate industrial resource, strengthen practice with theory. To help students develop professional attitudes and work ethics in order to plan their future career and enhance competitiveness.",
